Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 20:06:48 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Suggest secret names on export and one-click migrate
 sensitive literals.

Export now proposes per-finding secret keys, saves values to local secrets.ini, replaces type literals with {SecretName} tokens in the exported package and live script, then downloads a safe shareable package.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
